# Personal RSS Newsletter Agent - Environment Variables
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is OPTIONAL for local development if you already have
# Claude Code authentication available on your machine (e.g. `claude` CLI login).
#
# Set it here or in .env.local for API-key based runs, CI, or containers.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: override the model used by agent phases
# NEWSLETTER_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
